'''Neckless Chic''' (首なしスタイル, ''Kubi Nashi Sutairu'', '''No Neck Style''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Knockback" Effect UP (Sm): Knockback distance increases by 10%.

